o reported that the individual behavior was not applicable to them\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"PrEP percentage calculated only among those who reported negative or unknown HIV status (N = 720)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"AMIS is an annual, cross‐sectional, online behavioral survey of a convenience sample of cisgender men in the United States who report sex with another man during the 12 months preceding the survey\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}